
Third-party licenses in the shaded binary distribution
-----------------------------------------------------

The shaded JAR includes third-party components under their respective licenses.
Their bundled license texts are retained in this file, META-INF/LICENSE.txt,
the root LICENSE file, and the component-specific license files under META-INF.
See META-INF/DEPENDENCIES for component coordinates and META-INF/NOTICE for
attribution notices. In particular, the CDDL terms for javax.transaction:jta
are retained in META-INF/LICENSE.txt.
